@startuml
title UC3 - Cancel Appointment

start

:1. Select appointment to cancel;
:2. Submit cancellation request;

if (3. Appointment found & cancellable?) then (Yes)
  :4. Update status to Cancelled;
  :5. Show cancellation confirmation;
else (No)
  :6. Show cancellation error message;
endif

stop

note right
Activity Description:

1. Customer selects the appointment they want to cancel.
2. Customer submits the cancellation request.
3. System checks that the appointment exists and can be cancelled.
4. If valid, the system marks the appointment as Cancelled.
5. System shows a confirmation message.
6. If invalid, the system shows an error message.
end note

@enduml